ATOM66 macOS configuration utility. Ordinary hardware writes are UNQUALIFIED.

Usage: niz <COMMAND>

Commands:
  devices           
  info              
  raw-thresholds    Read the exact Atom66 firmware's raw normal-scan threshold snapshot
  backup            
  inspect           
  diff              
  set               
  swap              
  trial-swap        
  import            
  apply             
  restore           
  trial-single-key  
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
